Description: Python @PY_MAJOR_MINOR@ runtime for jailbroken iOS
 A complete Python @PY_MAJOR_MINOR@ runtime for arm64 jailbroken iOS devices.
 .
 Run Python directly from the command line with the standard library,
 HTTPS/TLS support through OpenSSL, ctypes support through libffi, and pip
 for installing compatible Python wheels.
 .
 Installed commands:
  * python3 and python@PY_MAJOR_MINOR@
  * pip, pip3, and pip@PY_MAJOR_MINOR@
 .
 Requires iOS @MIN_IOS@ or later.

